OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers continue across Argyll and
OL,7,FArran, but most paces will be dry with
OL,8,Fsome long clear spells developing.
OL,9,FChilly with mainly light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA bright and largely dry
OL,12,Fstart.
OL,13,
OL,14,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry,
OL,15,Fbright for much of Thursday then
OL,16,Fcloudier with occasionally heavy rain
OL,17,Flater. Rain clears overnight to leave
OL,18,FFriday and Saturday with sunny spells
OL,19,Fand frequent heavy, blustery showers.
